{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10103010","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10103010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1010301001:0":{"text":"呜……好冷！这天气……冷得我快要冬眠了……","source_cn":"呜……好冷！这天气……冷得我快要冬眠了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D92EC910A07073","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010301002:0":{"text":"我现在很确定，就是因为气候异变，导致南村葡萄的产量暴跌，弗朗茨才想抢夺北村的土地。","source_cn":"我现在很确定，就是因为气候异变，导致南村葡萄的产量暴跌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C1D2C23FF6458B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010301003:0":{"text":"那些葡萄我尝过了，似乎不是什么好东西，谁会买啊？","source_cn":"那些葡萄我尝过了，似乎不是什么好东西，谁会买啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD1B80A9ADEA05A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010301004:0":{"text":"据我所知，这些葡萄大部分都被 <style=\"highlight\">黑金商会</style>收购了。","source_cn":"据我所知，这些葡萄大部分都被 <style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A63696B025F94CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1010301011":{"text":"可是天气越来越冷了，也不知道以后金穗村会变成什么样……\n今年这些麦子，说不定是这片土地最后的馈赠。","source_cn":"可是天气越来越冷了，也不知道以后金穗村会变成什么样……\\n今年这些麦子，说不定是这片土地最后的馈赠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46A750C68D7F5F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010301005:0":{"text":"黑金……哦，是个前些年迅速壮大的商会，我在王都的时候听人说起过。","source_cn":"黑金……哦，是个前些年迅速壮大的商会，我在王都的时候听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3086D6A3A92D1AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010301006:0":{"text":"嗯，是那个很有名望的商会。<style=\"highlight\">黑金商会</style>一直想要赶超我们，垄断伊索米亚的商业。","source_cn":"嗯，是那个很有名望的商会。<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D9D0BEE57A3B313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010301007:0":{"text":"过去，秘银商会不曾把它们放在眼里。现在，它们已经快要和秘银商会平起平坐了。","source_cn":"过去，秘银商会不曾把它们放在眼里。现在，它们已经快要和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB55DDE4E0D62797A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010301008:0":{"text":"尽管很不甘心……但是不得不承认，他们的商业手段非常高明。","source_cn":"尽管很不甘心……但是不得不承认，他们的商业手段非常高明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x146D2CE9592E052C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010301009:0":{"text":"我对那些藤水晶没兴趣，这种葡萄价格昂贵，只有贵族才消费得起。我只在乎北村的麦子。","source_cn":"我对那些藤水晶没兴趣，这种葡萄价格昂贵，只有贵族才消费...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74E834A5F5FCE0AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_re